n Figure 2.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'CharacterizationMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306037)}, {'id': 'b1af3114-dffa-4acf-a32d-a7de9fade189', 'name': 'X-ray Fluorescence', 'label': 'X-ray Fluorescence', 'type': 'characterizationmethod', 'description': 'A method used to detect the chemical composition of fly ash and mullite, as presented in TABLE 1.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'CharacterizationMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306039)}, {'id': '588e1e04-0d63-42fc-b3b7-d5fa813c5b96', 'name': 'laser diffraction analysis', 'label': 'laser diffraction analysis', 'type': 'characterizationmethod', 'description': 'A technique used to measure particle size distribution of fly ash and mullite powder, performed using Malvern Instrument Mastersizer 2000.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'CharacterizationMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306042)}, {'id': '84777332-6c60-4f24-ab96-2d617c5ef554', 'name': 'Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM)', 'label': 'Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM)', 'type': 'characterizationmethod', 'description': 'A method used to analyze the morphology of polished surfaces of geopolymer samples, with samples gold-coated prior to observation.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'CharacterizationMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306044)}, {'id': '86713a82-866c-4ee1-ab01-1640c539b49b', 'name':