-42b2-8d16-4c2b1b1c1333', 'name': 'gold coating', 'label': 'gold coating', 'type': 'treatmentmethod', 'description': 'Applied to all samples prior to SEM observation to enhance conductivity and image quality.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'TreatmentMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306057)}, {'id': '99e84e60-9245-48ae-8d03-40ad6b930f22', 'name': 'NaOH concentration', 'label': 'NaOH concentration', 'type': 'parameter', 'description': 'A variable parameter in the activator solution, tested in the range of 8–16 mol/L to determine its effect on compressive strength.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'Parameter', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'concepts', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306059)}, {'id': 'b802ea37-575e-42fe-9c82-45102b90d622', 'name': 'optimum sodium hydroxide concentration at 12 mol/L', 'label': 'optimum sodium hydroxide concentration at 12 mol/L', 'type': 'parameter', 'description': 'The selected NaOH concentration that yields high and consistent compressive strength, chosen based on experimental results.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'Parameter', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'concepts', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306062)}, {'id': '8619bbf2-4bc8-4389-b5a2-02e5a1e0f1c0', 'name': 'cylindrical PVC molds', 'label': 'cylindrical PVC molds', 'type': 'fabricationmethod', 'description': 'Molds used for shaping geopolymer samples with dimensions ∅15 mm × 30 mm.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'FabricationMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306064)}, {'id': '5e2d0779-f6e9-4cd0-b8f8-dc38e0dd7716', 'name': 'hand stirring', 'label': 'hand stirring', 'type': 'mixingmethod', 'description': 'A manual mixing method used to combine dry fly ash with alkaline activator for 1 minute.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'MixingMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306067)}, {'id': '2abcf862-eaca-49e2-8934-7ccb8b2b41e9', 'name': 'chemical composition', 'label': 'chemical composition', 'type': 'parameter', 'description': 'Elemental oxide composition of raw materials as provided in Table 1, critical for determining reactivity and geopolymer network formation.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'Parameter', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'concepts', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306069)}, {'id': 'a71b1d74-667f-40bc-8742-d0a0bd0ecb3b', 'name': 'particle distribution', 'label': 'particle distribution', 'type': 'physicalproperty', 'description': 'The size distribution of fly ash and mullite particles, measured by laser diffraction analysis and presented in TABLE 2.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'PhysicalProperty', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed9-4533-86e3-8c45a72dca64', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2025, 7, 29, 20, 4, 9, 306072)}, {'id': '9e2cb667-047c-4def-9b3b-70038e4979d9', 'name': 'Figure 1', 'label': 'Figure 1', 'type': 'characterizationmethod', 'description': 'SEM pictures showing the morphology of raw materials, used for visual characterization.', 'properties': {'original_type': 'CharacterizationMethod', 'confidence': 0.8, 'source': 'llm_extraction'}, 'collection': 'entities', 'source_document_id': '6330b137-bed